{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/3cc0d251884d03a652f54539b3826815.avif?t=1762307636\" width=1560 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixplorer</strong> is a <strong>sandbox action-RPG</strong> that combines a 3D world with a 2D art style<strong>.</strong> Dive into a procedurally generated universe where you can\u00a0<strong>explore diverse biomes</strong>,\u00a0<strong>craft and build</strong>,\u00a0<strong>uncover hidden dungeons</strong>,\u00a0<strong>battle monsters</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>level up</strong>\u00a0your character. Whether you\u2019re constructing a cozy home, mastering real-time combat, or hunting rare fish and insects, it's <strong>your</strong> unique adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build in 3D</strong>\u00a0with blocks and all kind of objects,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time</strong>\u00a0<strong>combat\u00a0</strong>with\u00a0<strong>status effects, elemental attacks, parry\u00a0</strong>and\u00a0<strong>dodge</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 biomes\u00a0</strong>to explore, with\u00a0<strong>structures, dungeons</strong>\u00a0and puzzles,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ weapons :\u00a0</strong>swords, bows, hammers, spears, katars, daggers, and more,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ spells</strong>\u00a0: lightning strike, wind blade, ice javelin, fireball, health absorption, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90+ armor components:\u00a0</strong>chestplates, helmets, boots, belts, rings, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ monsters,\u00a0</strong>multiple bosses,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ fish</strong>\u00a0and insects to capture,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite world</strong>\u00a0with real-time procedural generation,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quicksave / quickload</strong>, freeze camera, hide UI, building assistant etc.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Images</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD OF CUBES</strong> -<strong> </strong>3D building with 2D art style !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/a63c12a16b85fd3cab9b3c1d5dbc6a84.poster.avif?t=1762307636\" width=896 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/a63c12a16b85fd3cab9b3c1d5dbc6a84.webm?t=1762307636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/a63c12a16b85fd3cab9b3c1d5dbc6a84.mp4?t=1762307636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>FACE THE WILDS </strong>- Walk around fights, or charge straight into them !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/81d7c9f0e5e78e8581c58e18785b3df8.poster.avif?t=1762307636\" width=896 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/81d7c9f0e5e78e8581c58e18785b3df8.webm?t=1762307636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/81d7c9f0e5e78e8581c58e18785b3df8.mp4?t=1762307636\" type=\"video/